Cat food appears as a currency item in Sangokushi Rumble that can be obtained by clearing the stage "Kimokawa☆Nyanko", and is used to roll in the collab-exclusive gacha. Cards rolled in the gacha increase the drop rate of Cat Food; SR cards double the rate, while LE Cards triple it.

