==Trivia==
*Each form of [[Cat Kart R (Rare Cat)|Cat Kart P]] attacks with a Cat Food can of a different color: orange (Normal), green (Evolved), and pink ([[True Form|True]]).
*[[Brainwashed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Island Cat]] and [[Malevolent Island Cat]] carry an opened gray and blue Cat Food can, respectively.
*Prior to [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], there was no limit on how many ads could be watched per day, so if properly automated a player could easily farm a large quantity of Cat Food without even playing the game.
*Prior to an unknown version, watching all 5 daily ads would trigger a Cat Bulletin, announcing that the Cat Food awarded from ads will be doubled.
*Strangely, the option to purchase 30 Cat Food in the Cat Food Shop is placed after the 330 Cat Food option, when it would make more sense for it to be placed at the start before the 90 Cat Food option.
*A singular Cat Food costs 3 cents in US dollars.
*One of the possible [[Cat Shrine|Cat Fortunes]] is "With Cat Food all things are possible."

